WEBVTT

00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:09.170
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:01:33.710 --> 00:01:36.910
In Guangzhou, the Spring Festival is
in the first lunar month of the year.

00:01:37.170 --> 00:01:39.240
It's also the liveliest time of the whole year.

00:01:41.740 --> 00:01:44.710
The biggest event during the Spring Festival

00:01:44.950 --> 00:01:46.360
(Guangzhou Dumpling Competition)
is Guangzhou Dumpling Competition.

00:01:47.230 --> 00:01:49.880
The selected top chefs from

00:01:49.930 --> 00:01:51.520
more than five thousand restaurants

00:01:51.980 --> 00:01:55.220
would compete for the title of
the best dumplings of Guangzhou.

00:01:55.410 --> 00:01:57.560
For the judges of the Competition,
the citizens of Guangzhou,

00:01:57.780 --> 00:01:59.710
it is the most popular event
during the Spring Festival.

00:01:59.840 --> 00:02:02.220
And for the chefs,

00:02:02.380 --> 00:02:03.910
it is an important Competition

00:02:03.960 --> 00:02:05.600
that relates to the reputation
of the restaurant.

00:02:07.880 --> 00:02:10.380
Flame Chef and Dumpling Brothers.

00:02:15.440 --> 00:02:16.660
There is only one week left.

00:02:18.320 --> 00:02:19.040
I wonder what kind of

00:02:19.140 --> 00:02:20.670
dumplings Chef Zhou Yu will make.

00:02:21.160 --> 00:02:22.430
I hope we can see them soon.

00:02:23.170 --> 00:02:24.490
It was a pity last year.

00:02:24.540 --> 00:02:26.270
We only got the second prize.

00:02:26.490 --> 00:02:28.490
So Chef Zhou Yu is extra motivated this year.

00:02:28.730 --> 00:02:29.750
But apart from last year's winner

00:02:29.800 --> 00:02:32.420
Guangzhou Dumpling Restaurant,

00:02:32.530 --> 00:02:34.320
Beiyuan Restaurant and Taotao Garden

00:02:34.360 --> 00:02:34.980
are also competitive.

00:02:35.060 --> 00:02:36.260
We can't forget them.

00:02:36.390 --> 00:02:37.830
Don't worry.

00:02:37.880 --> 00:02:40.010
Chef Zhou Yu will definitely be the winner.

00:02:40.340 --> 00:02:42.340
I can assure you.

00:02:42.450 --> 00:02:44.160
We will win!

00:02:44.590 --> 00:02:45.300
Ouch!

00:02:46.430 --> 00:02:47.770
Look at you! So confident!

00:02:47.820 --> 00:02:49.950
You are just a fourth-class chef.

00:02:56.520 --> 00:02:57.850
But, hasn't Chef Zhou Yu

00:02:58.010 --> 00:02:59.510
decided on the flavor?

00:03:11.990 --> 00:03:13.830
Chef Zhou Yu sprinkled green powder on the dough.

00:03:41.100 --> 00:03:43.420
The dumpling wrappers are flying in the air.

00:03:44.530 --> 00:03:45.180
He is amazing!

00:03:49.760 --> 00:03:50.190
He is so quick.

00:03:51.130 --> 00:03:52.810
How can his hands be so flexible?

00:04:04.620 --> 00:04:05.630
It's so colorful.

00:04:05.780 --> 00:04:07.470
Red sauce and green dumplings.

00:04:07.960 --> 00:04:09.740
I have never seen dumplings like these!

00:04:10.110 --> 00:04:10.920
It seems that

00:04:11.010 --> 00:04:13.010
a phoenix is spreading its green wings

00:04:13.110 --> 00:04:15.490
to fly to the sky.

00:04:16.030 --> 00:04:18.580
I call this dish the Phoenix and Jade Dumplings.

00:04:18.700 --> 00:04:19.810
Phoenix and Jade Dumplings.

00:04:19.960 --> 00:04:20.950
The red sauce is...

00:04:21.300 --> 00:04:24.210
Yeah, the inspiration comes from

00:04:24.260 --> 00:04:25.670
the Sichuan flavored red oil dumplings

00:04:26.060 --> 00:04:28.130
in your hometown.

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:29.230
Have a taste.

00:04:29.650 --> 00:04:30.270
Okay!

00:04:36.190 --> 00:04:37.250
It's sour-sweet.

00:04:37.540 --> 00:04:39.970
The spicy taste of the sauce is rich and strong.

00:04:40.840 --> 00:04:41.480
Its flavor is richer

00:04:41.530 --> 00:04:42.750
and more marvelous than

00:04:43.090 --> 00:04:44.780
that of the Sichuan flavored red oil sauce.

00:04:45.240 --> 00:04:46.710
What ingredient is it?

00:04:58.580 --> 00:05:00.790
Yes! The green powder

00:05:00.860 --> 00:05:02.950
is made of boiled spinach.

00:05:03.390 --> 00:05:05.130
The sweetness of spinach

00:05:05.340 --> 00:05:06.810
makes the spicy taste

00:05:06.860 --> 00:05:07.610
of the sauce unique.

00:05:07.920 --> 00:05:10.090
Awesome! Chef Zhou Yu never lets us down.

00:05:10.420 --> 00:05:12.580
The combination of red and green
is beautiful, too.

00:05:13.020 --> 00:05:15.110
See? I was right.

00:05:15.360 --> 00:05:17.710
Yang Spring Restaurant
will be the winner for sure.

00:05:20.180 --> 00:05:21.860
Phoenix and Jade Dumplings.

00:05:22.340 --> 00:05:23.000
He is awesome.

00:05:23.120 --> 00:05:25.130
Chef Zhou Yu deserves his reputation.

00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:26.870
Hi everyone!

00:05:27.400 --> 00:05:28.120
I heard that

00:05:28.240 --> 00:05:31.030
there is a popular dumpling stand in the city.

00:05:32.290 --> 00:05:34.550
I also heard that the
fried dumplings there are amazing.

00:05:34.670 --> 00:05:35.610
Rumor has it that

00:05:35.660 --> 00:05:37.410
it is one of the

00:05:37.530 --> 00:05:39.960
contenders for the championship.

00:05:40.890 --> 00:05:41.950
Fried dumpling stand?

00:05:42.250 --> 00:05:43.770
Where did it come from?

00:05:46.790 --> 00:05:48.530
The Spring Festival in Guangzhou

00:05:48.580 --> 00:05:49.720
is so lively!

00:05:50.070 --> 00:05:52.310
Even I start to get excited. Meili.

00:05:52.610 --> 00:05:53.600
I'm telling you.

00:05:53.650 --> 00:05:55.190
We are not here to have fun.

00:05:55.780 --> 00:05:56.990
Okay.

00:05:57.140 --> 00:05:59.450
I remember he said the stand is around here.

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:01.170
Hi everyone!

00:06:01.550 --> 00:06:03.210
Come here!

00:06:16.400 --> 00:06:17.600
This iron ball is

00:06:17.990 --> 00:06:19.970
as heavy as an adult.

00:06:20.410 --> 00:06:21.240
We have two iron balls.

00:06:21.540 --> 00:06:23.890
But for Aru,

00:06:24.180 --> 00:06:25.180
they are nothing.

00:06:26.950 --> 00:06:28.190
It's so interesting.

00:06:28.350 --> 00:06:30.180
That's what we should watch
during the Spring Festival.

00:06:30.230 --> 00:06:31.140
Right, Meili?

00:06:31.750 --> 00:06:33.060
What are you talking about?

00:06:33.300 --> 00:06:34.350
We don't have time to

00:06:34.430 --> 00:06:36.190
watch street show.

00:06:36.910 --> 00:06:37.610
Let's go!

00:06:43.060 --> 00:06:44.420
It's amazing! Go!

00:06:44.720 --> 00:06:45.520
Come with me!

00:06:46.610 --> 00:06:48.600
You are hopeless.

00:06:48.710 --> 00:06:49.730
Let's go!

00:06:50.040 --> 00:06:51.780
I'm having fun!

00:06:54.260 --> 00:06:56.040
All right. Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:06:59.960 --> 00:07:02.550
Our fried dumplings are finally ready.

00:07:03.270 --> 00:07:04.240
Their fried dumplings?

00:07:15.010 --> 00:07:16.570
Everybody, please eat!

00:07:18.870 --> 00:07:20.500
Are they...

00:07:21.010 --> 00:07:23.020
Are they really chefs?

00:07:23.170 --> 00:07:24.210
Haven't you heard?

00:07:24.360 --> 00:07:26.410
They are the Dumpling Brothers.

00:07:27.050 --> 00:07:28.230
Dumpling Brothers?

00:07:28.680 --> 00:07:30.760
No one knows where they come from.

00:07:31.130 --> 00:07:34.120
The one selling dumplings is big brother Takeo.

00:07:34.300 --> 00:07:36.270
The big guy with the iron balls

00:07:36.320 --> 00:07:37.130
is his little brother Aru.

00:07:37.690 --> 00:07:39.900
They have been selling dumplings
since the Spring Festival.

00:07:40.020 --> 00:07:41.370
They are very popular.

00:07:41.970 --> 00:07:43.500
And someone named them

00:07:43.840 --> 00:07:44.990
the Dumpling Brothers.

00:07:45.750 --> 00:07:47.830
Those will be sold out if I don't buy some now.

00:07:48.170 --> 00:07:48.990
Oh my god!

00:07:49.500 --> 00:07:50.550
Mao, wait here.

00:07:51.650 --> 00:07:52.860
I'll have two, please!

00:07:53.050 --> 00:07:54.360
I'll have three, please!

00:07:55.860 --> 00:07:57.880
Their fried dumplings are popular.

00:08:01.260 --> 00:08:02.110
I bought some.

00:08:02.210 --> 00:08:03.310
Have a taste.

00:08:08.070 --> 00:08:08.780
Are they good?

00:08:11.820 --> 00:08:13.230
Juicy fillings

00:08:13.500 --> 00:08:14.600
and chewy dumpling wrappers.

00:08:14.630 --> 00:08:15.840
They match perfectly.

00:08:17.900 --> 00:08:19.260
I've never had

00:08:19.310 --> 00:08:20.420
such delicious dumplings before.

00:08:20.810 --> 00:08:21.790
The little guy over there.

00:08:22.690 --> 00:08:24.260
You are a true expert.

00:08:24.670 --> 00:08:25.150
Yes.

00:08:25.480 --> 00:08:28.030
These are the best dumplings in Guangzhou.

00:08:28.470 --> 00:08:29.090
Ladies and gentlemen,

00:08:29.380 --> 00:08:31.460
the Guangzhou Dumpling Competition
is one week from now.

00:08:31.840 --> 00:08:32.630
Please wait and see

00:08:32.680 --> 00:08:34.440
our performance!

00:08:36.730 --> 00:08:38.790
Awesome! They are interesting!

00:08:39.170 --> 00:08:40.800
Go, Dumpling Brothers!

00:08:41.360 --> 00:08:43.630
I will come!

00:08:44.290 --> 00:08:46.370
But they won't win.

00:08:46.570 --> 00:08:48.050
Chef Zhou Yu's dumplings are better.

00:08:50.740 --> 00:08:51.880
Chef Zhou Yu?

00:08:52.640 --> 00:08:55.890
Chef Zhou Yu's dumplings have richer flavors.

00:08:56.210 --> 00:08:56.960
Yeah!

00:08:57.080 --> 00:08:59.020
We have the confidence to win. Mao.

00:08:59.120 --> 00:08:59.560
Yes!

00:09:04.360 --> 00:09:06.510
Are you talking about the Vice Chef

00:09:06.760 --> 00:09:09.830
of Yang Spring Restaurant Zhou Yu?

00:09:10.580 --> 00:09:12.590
I've heard a lot about him!

00:09:13.140 --> 00:09:15.430
But no one can be the winner forever.

00:09:16.070 --> 00:09:18.160
Your restaurant lost last year, right?

00:09:18.510 --> 00:09:19.130
But this year,

00:09:19.270 --> 00:09:21.380
Chef Zhou Yu's Phoenix and Jade Dumplings

00:09:21.430 --> 00:09:22.790
will definitely win!

00:09:22.900 --> 00:09:23.770
Yes! Yes!

00:09:24.930 --> 00:09:26.660
Phoenix and Jade Dumplings?

00:09:27.020 --> 00:09:29.350
What are Phoenix and Jade Dumplings?

00:09:29.980 --> 00:09:31.140
They may be newly

00:09:31.280 --> 00:09:32.880
created by Chef Zhou Yu.

00:09:33.020 --> 00:09:35.020
It's getting more interesting.

00:09:35.430 --> 00:09:36.100
Takeo.

00:09:37.310 --> 00:09:39.460
That confident little guy.

00:09:39.760 --> 00:09:40.790
Could you please

00:09:40.840 --> 00:09:41.990
tell Chef Zhou Yu

00:09:42.900 --> 00:09:43.940
that we are looking forward to

00:09:44.260 --> 00:09:46.820
meeting him one week later.

00:09:49.370 --> 00:09:50.290
Mao, let's go.

00:09:59.310 --> 00:10:00.300
Okay.

00:10:00.710 --> 00:10:03.250
Taotao Garden's dumplings are good, too.

00:10:04.240 --> 00:10:06.530
Mao, you really have a big stomach.

00:10:06.880 --> 00:10:08.410
I'm stuffed.

00:10:21.880 --> 00:10:23.290
Sir, are you okay?

00:10:26.470 --> 00:10:27.480
Father!

00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:28.760
Chef Zhou Yu!

00:10:28.880 --> 00:10:30.340
Father, hang in there.

00:10:31.950 --> 00:10:34.940
Are you okay, Chef Zhou Yu?

00:10:37.040 --> 00:10:38.000
He is injured badly.

00:10:38.080 --> 00:10:39.020
I'm afraid he can't

00:10:39.070 --> 00:10:39.850
compete in the dumpling Competition.

00:10:40.640 --> 00:10:41.740
He has been working so hard

00:10:41.790 --> 00:10:43.160
for this year's championship.

00:10:44.090 --> 00:10:44.790
Meili.

00:10:45.370 --> 00:10:46.430
I think,

00:10:46.760 --> 00:10:47.760
there must be someone

00:10:47.920 --> 00:10:49.960
who doesn't want Chef Zhou Yu to win.

00:10:50.040 --> 00:10:51.130
So that person attacked him.

00:10:51.420 --> 00:10:53.240
Yeah, it must be like that.

00:10:53.360 --> 00:10:54.750
Who would do such a thing?

00:10:57.820 --> 00:11:00.260
My gosh! I won't let him get away with it!

00:11:00.360 --> 00:11:01.900
No matter who did it.

00:11:01.950 --> 00:11:02.810
I'll catch him

00:11:02.860 --> 00:11:03.900
and revenge!

00:11:04.030 --> 00:11:06.120
Okay, let's revenge!

00:11:06.240 --> 00:11:07.450
Revenge!

00:11:07.890 --> 00:11:09.000
Idiots!

00:11:12.050 --> 00:11:13.340
Don't forget that we are chefs.

00:11:14.110 --> 00:11:15.800
Even if we revenge, we do it by cooking.

00:11:16.320 --> 00:11:17.020
But father,

00:11:17.040 --> 00:11:18.740
you can't compete now.

00:11:18.790 --> 00:11:19.650
What can we do now?

00:11:21.000 --> 00:11:22.270
I will choose someone to compete for me.

00:11:23.270 --> 00:11:24.800
Compete for Chef Zhou Yu?

00:11:25.370 --> 00:11:27.200
Who has the ability to do it?

00:11:35.110 --> 00:11:36.160
The one who will compete for me

00:11:37.500 --> 00:11:37.910
is Mao.

00:11:41.160 --> 00:11:42.480
You will compete in the dumpling Competition.

00:11:43.700 --> 00:11:44.370
Me?

00:11:51.200 --> 00:11:53.000
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:11:54.290 --> 00:11:55.130
Mao.

00:11:55.830 --> 00:11:56.780
For the dumpling Competition,

00:11:56.830 --> 00:11:58.400
you will make father's Phoenix and Jade Dumplings.

00:11:58.450 --> 00:11:59.100
Right?

00:12:01.310 --> 00:12:02.320
Or will you make something else?

00:12:04.860 --> 00:12:06.010
What will you make?

00:12:06.100 --> 00:12:07.070
Don't just nod!

00:12:07.120 --> 00:12:08.490
Answer my questions!

00:12:09.860 --> 00:12:11.240
I haven't decided.

00:12:12.760 --> 00:12:13.370
You haven't decided?

00:12:13.570 --> 00:12:15.090
The Competition is tomorrow!

00:12:15.590 --> 00:12:16.440
It smells good!

00:12:16.560 --> 00:12:18.730
Meili, I'll try the dumplings of that restaurant.

00:12:18.960 --> 00:12:20.380
Wait, Mao!

00:12:22.940 --> 00:12:25.150
Maybe they were right.

00:12:25.290 --> 00:12:26.610
Mao is not eligible to

00:12:26.660 --> 00:12:27.890
compete for my father.

00:12:28.530 --> 00:12:30.920
(Guangzhou Dumpling Restaurant)

00:12:30.970 --> 00:12:32.340
This is last year's winner,

00:12:32.390 --> 00:12:33.580
Guangzhou Dumpling Restaurant.

00:12:34.220 --> 00:12:35.350
The mystical steamed dumplings.

00:12:35.390 --> 00:12:36.780
Crown dumplings.

00:12:39.950 --> 00:12:40.930
Are they good, Mao?

00:12:41.250 --> 00:12:42.820
Every dumpling has two layers of dumpling wrappers.

00:12:42.980 --> 00:12:45.040
The taste is wonderful.

00:12:45.400 --> 00:12:47.230
The appearance is gorgeous and attractive.

00:12:48.480 --> 00:12:49.010
Yummy!

00:12:49.610 --> 00:12:51.100
They are made by our opponent.

00:12:51.190 --> 00:12:52.870
You can't praise them.

00:12:54.580 --> 00:12:56.500
Hey, is the boss here?

00:12:58.060 --> 00:13:00.810
There is something wrong with your steamed dumplings.

00:13:01.300 --> 00:13:01.920
Are they...

00:13:02.400 --> 00:13:03.190
Dumpling Brothers.

00:13:04.530 --> 00:13:06.200
What's wrong with our dumplings?

00:13:06.640 --> 00:13:07.690
Look yourself.

00:13:08.010 --> 00:13:09.670
I just slightly touched them with my chopsticks,

00:13:10.000 --> 00:13:11.580
and the wrappers broke.

00:13:11.710 --> 00:13:13.520
The soup completely came out.

00:13:13.630 --> 00:13:14.430
We will never

00:13:14.480 --> 00:13:15.520
make dumplings that break

00:13:15.560 --> 00:13:17.400
once touched by chopsticks.

00:13:17.540 --> 00:13:18.080
Listen up.

00:13:18.260 --> 00:13:19.020
The recipe of our steamed dumplings

00:13:19.070 --> 00:13:21.090
has been passed down through generations.

00:13:21.200 --> 00:13:22.390
These are Crown Dumplings,

00:13:22.480 --> 00:13:24.670
the winner of last year's dumpling Competition.

00:13:24.770 --> 00:13:25.170
Which is to say,

00:13:25.220 --> 00:13:26.960
these are the best dumplings in Guangzhou.

00:13:28.470 --> 00:13:29.350
Is that so?

00:13:32.740 --> 00:13:34.060
Yeah.

00:13:34.590 --> 00:13:35.870
The dumplings were steamed for too long.

00:13:35.920 --> 00:13:37.830
So the dumpling wrappers became soft.

00:13:37.900 --> 00:13:40.720
Look. It's a mess in the mouth.

00:13:40.770 --> 00:13:42.230
I can only taste the wrappers.

00:13:43.080 --> 00:13:45.080
I feel that I'm eating wonton.

00:13:45.780 --> 00:13:46.950
What are you talking about?

00:13:47.920 --> 00:13:49.410
This thing happens.

00:13:49.710 --> 00:13:50.880
The famous restaurant

00:13:50.930 --> 00:13:52.310
doesn't keep up with the times,

00:13:52.460 --> 00:13:53.440
and doesn't pay attention to

00:13:53.490 --> 00:13:55.210
the cooking,

00:13:55.260 --> 00:13:56.170
so the dishes taste worse.

00:13:56.900 --> 00:13:58.040
Am I right, everyone?

00:13:58.490 --> 00:14:00.100
The dumplings are awful.

00:14:00.150 --> 00:14:01.420
Are these really the best in Guangzhou?

00:14:02.500 --> 00:14:03.630
Now that I think about it,

00:14:03.680 --> 00:14:05.240
it really is a mess in the mouth.

00:14:05.880 --> 00:14:06.290
I feel that

00:14:06.340 --> 00:14:09.520
I'm eating wonton.

00:14:09.970 --> 00:14:11.970
Since the Dumpling Brothers said it,

00:14:12.050 --> 00:14:13.130
it must be right.

00:14:13.680 --> 00:14:14.930
Even you think that way.

00:14:15.290 --> 00:14:16.080
Get out!

00:14:16.450 --> 00:14:18.320
You don't appreciate the first-class flavor.

00:14:18.430 --> 00:14:20.360
We don't welcome customers like you!

00:14:21.330 --> 00:14:22.640
Oh my gosh!

00:14:22.740 --> 00:14:23.500
Everyone!

00:14:23.970 --> 00:14:26.240
He called customers idiots!

00:14:26.290 --> 00:14:27.850
Is that the right way to treat customers?

00:14:28.470 --> 00:14:29.660
He crossed the line.

00:14:29.790 --> 00:14:31.760
Even though he won the dumpling Competition,

00:14:31.880 --> 00:14:33.540
he shouldn't have said that.

00:14:33.950 --> 00:14:34.360
Yeah.

00:14:34.510 --> 00:14:35.790
Everyone,

00:14:35.880 --> 00:14:37.550
his dumplings must be more expensive

00:14:37.600 --> 00:14:40.240
than those of other restaurants.

00:14:41.370 --> 00:14:42.750
You are right.

00:14:46.130 --> 00:14:47.010
You!

00:14:47.600 --> 00:14:48.780
I won't let you get away with it!

00:14:53.480 --> 00:14:54.090
Master!

00:14:54.820 --> 00:14:55.490
It's strange.

00:14:56.270 --> 00:14:58.550
These dumplings are no way overcooked.

00:14:59.220 --> 00:15:00.360
They are delicious.

00:15:00.940 --> 00:15:02.420
Those two people look suspicious.

00:15:04.030 --> 00:15:05.010
Let go of my master!

00:15:17.600 --> 00:15:18.360
Everybody,

00:15:18.860 --> 00:15:20.360
whether he won

00:15:20.410 --> 00:15:21.930
the dumpling Competition or not,

00:15:22.240 --> 00:15:24.490
he stirred up a fight with customers.

00:15:24.870 --> 00:15:25.570
A man like him

00:15:25.630 --> 00:15:27.720
can never be a good chef.

00:15:28.180 --> 00:15:29.260
Yes!

00:15:29.380 --> 00:15:30.230
This year's dumpling Competition,

00:15:30.280 --> 00:15:31.060
I will never eat the dumplings

00:15:31.110 --> 00:15:32.820
from this restaurant.

00:15:32.870 --> 00:15:34.550
Yeah, me either!

00:15:34.950 --> 00:15:36.560
Good job, Dumpling Brothers!

00:15:36.720 --> 00:15:38.400
Thank you for defending our rights!

00:15:38.520 --> 00:15:40.880
Everybody, tomorrow is the dumpling Competition.

00:15:41.280 --> 00:15:42.680
Please support the dumplings of

00:15:42.730 --> 00:15:44.360
Dumpling Brothers!

00:15:44.670 --> 00:15:46.280
Okay!

00:15:47.760 --> 00:15:48.390
Sir,

00:15:49.320 --> 00:15:50.780
despite what happened just now,

00:15:51.030 --> 00:15:51.610
I look forward to

00:15:51.660 --> 00:15:52.360
your performance tomorrow.

00:15:52.690 --> 00:15:54.180
And of course,

00:15:54.230 --> 00:15:55.160
if you can come tomorrow.

00:15:58.170 --> 00:15:59.080
We are looking forward to

00:15:59.130 --> 00:16:00.580
meeting him one week later.

00:16:09.590 --> 00:16:11.540
Dumpling Brothers, stop!

00:16:13.240 --> 00:16:15.090
Isn't this the little guy from Yang Spring Restaurant?

00:16:15.530 --> 00:16:18.010
You are the ones who attacked Chef Zhou Yu!

00:16:18.570 --> 00:16:20.150
What? Them?

00:16:23.440 --> 00:16:25.350
How can you say that?

00:16:25.480 --> 00:16:26.340
What are you talking about?

00:16:26.910 --> 00:16:27.410
Meili.

00:16:27.990 --> 00:16:29.360
I know what kind of dumplings
I will make tomorrow.

00:16:30.840 --> 00:16:32.040
Like Chef Zhou Yu said.

00:16:32.400 --> 00:16:33.600
I'm a chef.

00:16:33.870 --> 00:16:35.480
Even if I revenge, I should do it by cooking.

00:16:36.040 --> 00:16:39.130
Let's see who is the best by making fried dumplings.

00:16:39.730 --> 00:16:40.540
Dumpling Brothers.

00:16:52.850 --> 00:16:54.460
Let's see who is the best, Dumpling Brothers.

00:16:56.350 --> 00:16:58.400
Before we become the best of Guangzhou,

00:16:58.790 --> 00:17:01.120
we can never lose to anyone.

00:17:02.060 --> 00:17:04.860
The day

00:17:05.220 --> 00:17:06.580
the winner of Guangzhou Dumpling Competition

00:17:06.630 --> 00:17:08.530
opened a branch store

00:17:09.030 --> 00:17:09.640
right across our restaurant,

00:17:09.700 --> 00:17:10.950
our battle began.

00:17:11.460 --> 00:17:13.290
Please try our dumplings

00:17:13.340 --> 00:17:14.490
and make a comparison!

00:17:14.610 --> 00:17:16.540
Our dumplings are no worse
than those of their restaurant.

00:17:16.820 --> 00:17:19.000
It doesn't matter whether we have the award or not.

00:17:19.430 --> 00:17:20.220
Idiot!

00:17:20.720 --> 00:17:21.870
Who would eat the food

00:17:21.920 --> 00:17:24.390
cooked by an unknown chef?

00:17:24.630 --> 00:17:26.590
Wake up!

00:17:30.770 --> 00:17:31.470
What are you doing?

00:17:33.480 --> 00:17:34.130
Takeo!

00:17:38.170 --> 00:17:39.110
If you are not convinced,

00:17:39.160 --> 00:17:41.970
compete in the Guangzhou Dumpling Competition.

00:17:42.680 --> 00:17:44.090
Your restaurant is about to

00:17:44.140 --> 00:17:45.540
close down anyway.

00:17:45.680 --> 00:17:47.180
You should make cheap dumplings.

00:17:47.220 --> 00:17:49.710
They suit you.

00:17:53.560 --> 00:17:55.720
At that moment, I swore I would

00:17:55.820 --> 00:17:58.060
win the dumpling Competition

00:17:58.200 --> 00:18:00.250
and get all the honor and prize money

00:18:00.660 --> 00:18:02.690
to rebuild our restaurant.

00:18:03.410 --> 00:18:05.350
We will make everyone believe that

00:18:05.390 --> 00:18:06.980
only Dumpling Brothers' dumplings

00:18:07.550 --> 00:18:09.630
are the dumplings of Guangzhou.

00:18:10.540 --> 00:18:11.480
To achieve this goal,

00:18:12.090 --> 00:18:13.530
I will do anything.

00:18:20.010 --> 00:18:23.900
(Yang Spring Restaurant)

00:18:23.990 --> 00:18:26.450
Mao, the Competition is about to start.

00:18:29.100 --> 00:18:31.250
What is he thinking?

00:18:32.280 --> 00:18:33.600
It's the dumpling Competition.

00:18:33.650 --> 00:18:35.820
Why is he making soup?

00:18:36.310 --> 00:18:37.550
No matter what he thinks,

00:18:37.600 --> 00:18:38.930
he won't win.

00:18:40.140 --> 00:18:41.270
Isn't this Chef Zhou Yu

00:18:41.380 --> 00:18:42.490
that everyone knows

00:18:43.520 --> 00:18:45.860
in Guangzhou?

00:18:47.680 --> 00:18:49.190
Takeo of the Dumpling Brothers.

00:18:50.130 --> 00:18:52.080
Oh, you are injured.

00:18:52.210 --> 00:18:53.540
The back luck comes to you at New Year.

00:18:53.590 --> 00:18:54.490
It's such a pity.

00:18:54.590 --> 00:18:55.920
You are a fine one to talk!

00:18:56.930 --> 00:18:57.480
Anyway,

00:18:57.670 --> 00:19:00.050
I heard that little guy,

00:19:00.680 --> 00:19:01.330
sorry,

00:19:01.860 --> 00:19:02.450
Mao,

00:19:02.490 --> 00:19:04.400
is a recommended chef by the leading figure

00:19:04.830 --> 00:19:07.300
of Chinese cuisine Provincial Military Commander Li.

00:19:07.630 --> 00:19:09.410
I didn't know it before.

00:19:12.210 --> 00:19:14.740
Please forgive my rudeness.

00:19:19.500 --> 00:19:21.940
It's such a unique way to say hello.

00:19:22.570 --> 00:19:25.150
Never mind. I hope you can do well in the Competition.

00:19:25.300 --> 00:19:26.980
Friends from Yang Spring Festival.

00:19:28.980 --> 00:19:30.310
I will never surrender!

00:19:30.660 --> 00:19:31.640
Dumpling Brothers!

00:19:33.430 --> 00:19:35.980
The key to win the Competition

00:19:36.190 --> 00:19:37.390
is the kneading of the wrappers and stuffing.

00:19:37.960 --> 00:19:40.250
With the wrappers and stuffing kneaded by Aru,

00:19:40.630 --> 00:19:43.150
and my special frying method,

00:19:43.440 --> 00:19:44.870
the title of the best in Guangzhou
and million yen prize money

00:19:44.920 --> 00:19:46.290
will be ours.

00:19:47.530 --> 00:19:50.460
Okay. The Spring Festival event

00:19:50.600 --> 00:19:52.570
held by Guangdong Chef Union,

00:19:52.680 --> 00:19:54.540
the Guangzhou Dumpling Competition

00:19:54.640 --> 00:19:55.990
will begin in a minute.

00:19:56.320 --> 00:19:57.690
This year, the Competition attracted

00:19:57.790 --> 00:20:00.100
(Beiyuan Restaurant, Caixiang Restaurant)
top chefs from all over Guangzhou.

00:20:00.180 --> 00:20:01.340
(Beiyuan Restaurant, Caixiang Restaurant)
Today in Huaiguang Temple,

00:20:01.430 --> 00:20:02.810
(Penglai Restaurant, Taotao Garden)
all kinds of dumplings will

00:20:02.910 --> 00:20:04.890
be presented in front of you.

00:20:04.940 --> 00:20:06.400
Okay! Stop talking and start the Competition!

00:20:06.450 --> 00:20:07.630
Yes! Yeah!

00:20:08.000 --> 00:20:09.500
The rules are still the same.

00:20:09.920 --> 00:20:10.770
The winner is decided by

00:20:10.820 --> 00:20:13.300
how many dumplings the customers have ate.

00:20:13.700 --> 00:20:15.440
The Competition stops when the sun goes down.

00:20:15.760 --> 00:20:16.330
Which is to say,

00:20:16.580 --> 00:20:17.550
when the sun

00:20:17.600 --> 00:20:19.830
completely disappears,

00:20:20.200 --> 00:20:23.680
the restaurant that has the biggest number of
empty plates is the winner.

00:20:24.860 --> 00:20:26.490
This year's Guangzhou Dumpling Competition

00:20:26.590 --> 00:20:28.090
will begin right away.

00:20:31.920 --> 00:20:34.080
All right. From the venue

00:20:34.130 --> 00:20:36.360
comes the smell of dumplings.

00:20:36.410 --> 00:20:37.790
Welcome!

00:20:38.150 --> 00:20:39.690
Please eat!

00:20:40.030 --> 00:20:41.280
Thank you!

00:20:41.330 --> 00:20:42.370
Welcome!

00:20:42.970 --> 00:20:44.780
Mao, everyone else has started!

00:20:46.850 --> 00:20:48.810
Hi everybody!

00:20:49.050 --> 00:20:50.210
Please come here!

00:20:51.850 --> 00:20:52.550
Ladies and gentlemen,

00:20:52.900 --> 00:20:54.470
thank you so much for coming here.

00:20:55.030 --> 00:20:56.250
Today we have prepared

00:20:56.300 --> 00:20:57.680
special dumplings for you!

00:20:58.090 --> 00:20:59.130
Today's dumplings are

00:20:59.180 --> 00:21:00.600
of a different flavor!

00:21:02.410 --> 00:21:03.310
It's fire!

00:21:03.420 --> 00:21:04.300
He makes the dumplings

00:21:04.350 --> 00:21:06.420
look like burning flames.

00:21:11.500 --> 00:21:12.670
Attention, please.

00:21:12.800 --> 00:21:14.470
The best part is about to begin.

00:21:14.620 --> 00:21:16.230
Please pay attention.

00:21:18.340 --> 00:21:19.690
What's inside the bottle?

00:21:19.930 --> 00:21:21.960
I wonder what is in Aru's mouth.

00:21:22.410 --> 00:21:23.120
It's dangerous.

00:21:23.290 --> 00:21:24.090
Customers over there.

00:21:24.200 --> 00:21:25.620
Please step back a bit.

00:21:27.420 --> 00:21:28.760
What will he do?

00:23:14.893 --> 00:23:16.936
Preview of the next episode

00:23:18.187 --> 00:23:21.524
Good! Liu Maoxing's special fried dumplings are ready!

00:23:21.524 --> 00:23:23.277
…Huh? Wait a minute.

00:23:23.359 --> 00:23:25.778
It tastes... It tastes different.

00:23:25.778 --> 00:23:28.365
This sauce is not the one I made.

00:23:28.490 --> 00:23:30.576
Next episode, Chūka Ichiban!

00:23:30.576 --> 00:23:33.328
A Despicable Trap! Mao Cornered

00:23:33.328 --> 00:23:34.871
It will definitely be interesting!
